step 47 "cast 'chain lightning' drunk"
out cher "A lightning bolt leaps from your hand and arcs to the drunk.\n\rYour lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the drunk!\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe drunk's leg is sliced from his dead body.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the duck!\n\rYour lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the duck!\n\rThe duck is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe duck's head is shattered, and his brains splash all over you.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the goblin!\n\rYour lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the goblin!\n\rThe goblin is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe goblin's leg is sliced from his dead body.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the beastly fido!\n\rYour lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the beastly fido!\n\rThe beastly fido is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rYou hear the beastly fido's death cry.\n\rYou are struck by your own lightning!\n\rYour lightning === OBLITERATES === you!\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rYou sure are BLEEDING!\n\rThe bolt grounds out through your body.\n\r\n\r<16hp 29910m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out god "\n\rCherub utters the words, 'chain lightning'.\n\rA lightning bolt leaps from Cherub's hand and arcs to the drunk.\n\rCherub's lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the drunk!\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rThe drunk's leg is sliced from his dead body.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the duck!\n\rCherub's lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the duck!\n\rThe duck is DEAD!!\n\rThe duck's head is shattered, and his brains splash all over you.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the goblin!\n\rCherub's lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the goblin!\n\rThe goblin is DEAD!!\n\rThe goblin's leg is sliced from his dead body.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the beastly fido!\n\rCherub's lightning <<< ERADICATES >>> the beastly fido!\n\rThe beastly fido is DEAD!!\n\rYou hear the beastly fido's death cry.\n\rThe bolt arcs to Cherub...whoops!\n\rCherub's lightning === OBLITERATES === him!\n\rThe bolt seems to have fizzled out.\n\r\n\r<100hp 29928m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
